    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 1 Westfield View to the Ashbourne property market.\r\n\r\n3 BEDROOM | 3 BATHROOM\r\n\r\nThis spacious three-bedroom end-of-terrace family home is ideally positioned within a popular residential development, offering excellent potential for those seeking space, convenience, and a welcoming neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation begins with a bright and generously proportioned entrance hall, creating an immediate sense of space upon arrival. Straight ahead lies a spacious living room, complete with a feature fireplace and an opening through to the family room. This additional reception space benefits from large double doors providing direct access to the rear garden, making it ideal for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is positioned just off the family room and is fitted with a range of wall and base units, offering ample workspace and storage. The ground floor is further complemented by a large dining room, which connects seamlessly to both the kitchen and living room, creating excellent flow throughout the home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a primary bedroom with en-suite, as well as a family bathroom serving the remaining accommodation.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property boasts a spacious, low-maintenance rear garden, complete with the added benefit of a large block-built shed, providing excellent additional storage.\r\n\r\nAshbourne is a vibrant and thriving town just 20 minutes from Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport, making it ideal for commuters. The area offers a wide range of amenities including excellent schools, restaurants, cafés, shops, and leisure facilities. With easy access to the M2 and M50 motorways, and a strong sense of community, Ashbourne continues to grow in popularity as one of Meath's most desirable places to live.\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n*All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided to us by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have.*"
      },
